    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d23">

                <pb facs="0116" n="87" xml:id="pg87"/>

                <head>23. Memorandum From the President’s Assistant for National Security Affairs
                        (Clark) to President
                        Reagan<anchor n="1" xml:id="d23-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1982-05-24">May 24, 1982</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Additional Guidance on START</item>
                </list>
                <p rendition="#section-heading #italic">Issue</p>
                <p>Should you issue an NSDD reflecting the
                    decisions reached as a result of the May 21 NSC
                        meeting<anchor n="2" xml:id="d23-f2"/> on START?</p>
                <p rendition="#section-heading #italic">Facts</p>
                <p>The NSC meeting on May 21 provides the basis for
                    you to issue additional guidance on the U.S. START position.</p>
                <p rendition="#section-heading #italic">Discussion</p>
                <p>Formalizing your decisions as a result of that meeting in an NSDD, will best ensure their clear transmission
                    and timely implementation.</p>
                <p rendition="#section-heading #italic">Recommendation</p>
                <table cols="3">
                    <row>
                        <cell><hi rendition="#roman">OK</hi></cell>
                        <cell><hi rendition="#roman">NO</hi></cell>
                        <cell/>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>________</cell>
                        <cell>________</cell>
                        <cell><hi rendition="#roman">That you approve and sign for release the
                                proposed NSDD at Tab
                                A.</hi><anchor n="3" xml:id="d23-f3"/></cell>
                    </row>
                </table>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d23-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d23-f1-content">
                <p>Source: National Security Council, National Security Council Institutional Files,
                    Box SR 078, NSDD 36 [START Negotiations II]. Secret. Sent for action.
                    Prepared by Kraemer and Linhard. A stamped notation at the top of
                    the memorandum reads: “signed.”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d23-f2" n="2" xml:id="d23-f2-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d21">Document 21</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d23-f3" n="3" xml:id="d23-f3-content">
                <p>Reagan initialed his approval. The NSDD is
                    printed below as <ref target="#d24">Document 24</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
